alue":"N _ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小；\n（2）求小货箱在分拣滑台上滑行的加速度a的大小，及传送带速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v _ { 1 }"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小；\n（3）当100号货箱到达P点并完成检测时，本次传送带输送任务结束。求要完成此次分拣传输任务，相比传送带空载运行，发动机因输送小货箱需多做多少功？\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1b6c35de58348c763fa3d91af9f1875d48d73aa0f7ed4a34fdc2c5197b96970a.png","width":960,"height":232,"width_mm":112.81,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2608-q17-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/27e9038b50b75cf4cde07ea0c9ac11dd835374ffecb17566f197be42061d1980.png","width":286,"height":189,"width_mm":33.608,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2608-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 17 题图甲\n第17题图乙"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"score","value":"（12分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（1）小货箱冲上分拣台滑行时，分拣台、挡板对小货箱的弹力分别为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"N_1=mg\\cos\\theta=8\\mathrm N"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"math","value":"N_2=mg\\sin\\theta=6\\mathrm N"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）设小货箱在分拣台滑行加速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"a_2"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_1N_1+\\mu_2N_2=ma_2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"a_2=6.4\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"设小货箱1从B点滑上分拣台时的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，恰好停在P点，则"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B1}^2=2a_2\\frac{L_2}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B1}=1.6\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n设小货箱1在传送带上加速，且加速度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"a_1"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_1N_1-\\mu_2N_2=ma_1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"a_1=1.6\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，加速距离"},{"type":"math","value":"s_1=\\frac{v_{B1}^2-v_0^2}{2a_1}=0.6\\mathrm m<L_1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可知甲在传送带上先加速，后匀速，故传送带速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_1=v_{B1}=1.6\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"2与1在P点碰撞过程动量守恒，碰后乙停止，有"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{2P}=mv_{1P}"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"即碰撞过程交换速度，相当于小货箱从B点匀减速直线运动至C点时，速度恰为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_0=0.8\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"故"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B2}^2-v_0^2=2a_2L_2"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B2}=2.4\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n2在传送带上加速距离"},{"type":"math","value":"s_2=\\frac{v_{B2}^2-v_0^2}{2a_1}=1.6\\mathrm m<L_1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可知小货箱2在传送带上先加速后匀速，故传送带速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_2=v_{B2}=2.4\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）方法一：传送带速度调为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_1=1.6\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"，小货箱1加速时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_1=\\frac{v_1-v_0}{a_1}=0.5\\mathrm s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n与传送带的相对位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_1=v_1t_1-\\left(v_0t_1+\\frac12a_1t_1^2\\right)=\\frac15\\mathrm m"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"故传送带传输1，多做的功"},{"type":"math","value":"W_1=\\frac12mv_1^2-\\frac12mv_0^2+\\mu_1N_1x_1+\\mu_2N_2L_1=6.56\\mathrm J"},{"type":"score","value":"2分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"传送带调速为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_2=2.4\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"，，小货箱滑上传送带加速时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_2=\\frac{v_2-v_0}{a_1}=1.0\\mathrm s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n与传送带的相对位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_2=v_2t_2-\\left(v_0t_2+\\frac12a_1t_2^2\\right)=\\frac45\\mathrm m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故传送带传输2，发动机多做功\n"},{"type":"math","value":"W_2=\\frac12mv_2^2-\\frac12mv_0^2+\\mu_1N_1x_2+\\mu_2N_2L_1=10.56\\mathrm J"},{"type":"score","value":"2分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"全部完成100个小货箱的分拣传输，发动机需要多做功"},{"type":"math","value":"W=W_1+(100-1)W_2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"W=6.56\\mathrm J+1045.44\\mathrm J=1052\\mathrm J"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"方法二：对传送带做功分析，传送带维持匀速需要额外施加一个力，大小等于工件与传送带的摩擦。\n"},{"type":"text","value":"传送带上加速用a₁。第一个货箱，加速过程有"},{"type":"math","value":"v_1=v_0+a_1t_1"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"t_1=0.5\\mathrm s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n加速过程工件的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_1=v_0t_1+\\frac12a_1t_1^2=\\frac35\\mathrm m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n传送带的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"v_1t_1"},{"type":"text","value":"，剩余一起匀速的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"L_1-x_1"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"多做的功"},{"type":"math","value":"W_1=\\mu_1N_1v_1t_1+\\mu_2N_2(L_1-x_1)=6.56\\mathrm J"},{"type":"score","value":"2分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"第2号货箱到第100个货箱，加速过程有，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_2=v_0+a_1t_2"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"t_2=1.0\\mathrm s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n加速过程工件的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_2=v_0t_2+\\frac12a_1t_2^2=\\frac85\\mathrm m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n传送带的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"v_2t_2"},{"type":"text","value":"，剩余一起匀速的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"L_1-x_2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n多做的功"},{"type":"math","value":"W_2=\\mu_1N_1v_2t_2+\\mu_2N_2(L_1-x_2)=10.56\\mathrm J"},{"type":"score","value":"2分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"总共多做的功"},{"type":"math","value":"W=W_1+(100-1)W_2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n代入数据，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"W=1052\\mathrm J"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"}]}},{"id":"zj-27-shoukao--z20-lianmeng-2608-q18","paper_id":"zj-27-shoukao--z20-lianmeng-2608","source_question_id":"z20-lianmeng-2608-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3c44f83809f9a2e71ae96618905f46acbacc02202d4025182786e4eee387e1b6","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. 高速磁悬浮列车的技术有多种，某实验小组对其中的超导电动磁悬浮技术的悬浮原理和常导电磁悬浮技术的制动原理进行探究。超导电动磁悬浮列车的悬浮原理:如图甲、图乙所示，列车侧面安装有低温超导磁体，分析原理时可等效为条形永磁铁。在轨道两侧对称安装了“8”字形结构的悬浮线圈，线圈由上下两个完全相同的矩形线框在交叉点P点串联反接而成，超导磁体的磁场方向始终垂直于“8”字线圈。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bce9da4082d14c507b7a33b808a147d09822da52789f5d2fc21a9d1b67f7402e.png","width":345,"height":191,"width_mm":40.485,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2608-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1d65366a5a3a66e4f722b47a4cbd6c0af99488a0fe340af47c9df01cb57b24bc.png","width":307,"height":198,"width_mm":36.069,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2608-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/92dee351a3d215256a859aa5fcd98585fa8742217e78ccc7e5ed0d99e9f755ba.png","width":613,"height":227,"width_mm":71.953,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2608-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图丙\n（1）当列车低速时，此时磁场中心轴线与“8”字形线圈P点等高，判断线圈有无感应电流，并说出判断依据？\n（2）当列车高速运行且辅助轮收起时，列车向下偏移，磁场中心轴线低于P点如图丙，回答下列问题:\n①“8”字形线圈对磁铁竖直方向的力F是向上还是向下？\n②列车速度越大，F越大还是越小？\n（3）常导电磁悬浮列车利用长定子直线同步电机产生的移动磁场进行制动，将其简化为如图丁所示模型:轨道两侧连续分布着宽度均为L的匀强磁场区域，相邻区域的磁场方向相反，磁感应强度大小均为B。一质量为m、有效切割边长L、电阻R的正方形导线框abcd等效为列车，线框平面和磁场垂直，ad、bc边始终平行于磁场边界。初始时线框以 "},{"type":"math","value":"v _ { 1 } { = } 0 . 8 v _ { 0 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 向右匀速运动，制动时整个磁场区域以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v _ { 0 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 向左匀速运动，线框经时间t减到零。已知线框所受的阻力 f = kv，比例系数 k近似取 "},{"type":"math","value":"k = \\frac { B ^ { 2 } L ^ { 2 } } { R }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求减速过程中线框运动的距离x和克服阻力f做的功 "},{"type":"math","value":"W _ { f }"},{"type":"text","value":" 。（最终答案用m、 "},{"type":"math","value":"v _ { 0 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 、k、t表示)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/efc3177a305efdb7467da2006ce8048fcc36dcc80629353bdc95cda5f34baa1e.png","width":782,"height":233,"width_mm":91.827,"row_group":"z20-lianmeng-2608-q18-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图丁"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"score","value":"（13分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（1）无"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"“8”字线圈在P点串联反接的，上下两个矩形线框产生的感应电动势大小一样，方向相反，回路总的感应电动势为0"},{"type":"score","value":"2分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）F方向向上，当列车速度越大，F越大"},{"type":"score","value":"2分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）感应电动势为"},{"type":"math","value":"E=2BL(v_0+v)"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac ER"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由动量定理"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum 2ILB\\Delta t+\\sum kv\\Delta t=mv_1"},{"type":"score","value":"2分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"令"},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\sum v\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"k=\\frac{B^2L^2}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"4kv_0t+5kx=mv_1"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"x=0.16\\frac{mv_0}{k}-0.8v_0t"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"由动能定理可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum F_A\\Delta x+\\sum kv\\Delta x=\\frac12mv_1^2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum\\frac{4B^2L^2(v_0+v)}{R}\\Delta x+\\sum kv\\Delta x=\\frac12mv_1^2"},{"type":"score","value":"2分\n"},{"type":"text","value":"即"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4B^2L^2v_0}{R}\\sum\\Delta x+\\frac{4B^2L^2}{R}\\sum v\\Delta x+k\\sum v\\Delta x=\\frac12m(0.8v_0)^2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n令"},{"type":"math","value":"k\\sum v\\Delta x=W_f"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4B^2L^2}{R}\\sum v\\Delta x=4W_f"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"},{"type":"math","value":"4kv_0x+5W_f=\\frac12m(0.8v_0)^2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n代入得"},{"type":"math","value":"W_f=(0.64kt-0.064m)v_0^2"},{"type":"score","value":"1分\n"}]}}]}
